<title>ZAMBIA: Zambia August consumer prices up 49.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Zambia August consumer prices up 49.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia's all-items consumer price index rose 2.8 percent in August from July, bringing the year-on-year increase to 49.4 percent, the central bank said.</p>
<p>				   Aug 1996	  Jul 1996    Aug 1995</p>
<p>Year-on-year pct change    49.4		47.1	  28.7</p>
<p>All-items index		199.4	     193.9	 133.5</p>
<p>(Base: 1985=100)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
